Package: siopr
Title: Brazilian Federal Budget ('SIOP') and Parliamentary Amendments
    ('Portal da Transparencia') Open Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("André", "Leite", email = "leite@castlab.org", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-4718-9766"))
Description: Tidyverse-friendly access to public sources of the Brazilian
    federal budget: the SPARQL endpoint and the official CSV files of the
    'SIOP' open data portal (Federal Budget Secretariat, SOF/MPO)
    <https://www1.siop.planejamento.gov.br/>, including the budget lines of
    parliamentary amendments (primary result codes 6, 7, 8 and 9) with
    their full classification and execution values, and the REST API of the
    'Portal da Transparencia' (CGU)
    <https://api.portaldatransparencia.gov.br/> for amendments by author
    and their expense documents. No 'SIOP' credential is required; the
    'Portal da Transparencia' needs a free API key. Results are tibbles,
    with codes as text and monetary values as numbers.
